      "created_at": "2013-06-21T12:44:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>But incapacitated isn't dead, right?</p><p>Although you could argue that if all heroes are incapped they're at the mercy of the villain and may well end up dead..</p><p>... but villains never do that. They'd end up locked away in a supposedly Inescapable Prison or attached unattended to a Certain Death Machine so that their (other) fellow heroes could effect a daring rescue!</p>",
